sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: Charging Station has log information available
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Memory State: N/a
    Note over CS,CSMS: Reusable State: N/a

    CSMS->>CS: GetLogRequest (logType = DiagnosticsLog)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: GetLogRequest<br>logType must be DiagnosticsLog
    CS-->>CSMS: GetLogResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: LogStatusNotificationRequest (status = Uploading, requestId = same Id as the GetLogRequest)
    CSMS-->>CS: LogStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: LogStatusNotificationRequest (status = Uploaded, requestId = same Id as the GetLogRequest)
    CSMS-->>CS: LogStatusNotificationResponse

    Note over CS,CSMS: Post scenario validations: N/a
